<title>JAPAN: Rubin to visit Japan on April 4 - U.S. embassy.</title>
<headline>Rubin to visit Japan on April 4 - U.S. embassy.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin will visit Japan on April 4 ahead of the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) forum's finance ministers' meeting in Manila, a U.S. embassy spokesman said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;I can confirm that Secretary Rubin does intend to stop in Japan on his way to the APEC finance ministers' meeting,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said that Rubin was expected to discuss subjects of bilateral interest with Japanese authorities during his visit and leave Japan early the next day, but could not elaborate on what the specific topics might be.</p>
</text>
